(?GROUP 8 API + POSTMAN FULL GUIDE \(REQUIRED ENDPOINTS\)) Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-05-24) Tj
T*
(Audience: Groupmates who need a complete, copy-paste workflow.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(0\) WHY YOU GET 400 BAD REQUEST IN POSTMAN \(EVEN IF APP WORKS\)) Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(Your backend enforces encrypted transport payloads for API requests and responses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What this means:) Tj
T*
(- If request has a body, backend expects header: X-Payload-Encryption: v1) Tj
T*
(- Request body must be JSON envelope: { "payload": "<base64 opaque payload>" }) Tj
T*
(- Sending plain JSON like {"email":"...","password":"..."} will fail) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Backend sources:) Tj
T*
(- api/index.php wires encrypted transport for all requests/responses) Tj
T*
(- backend/src/Http/Request.php validates/decrypts incoming body) Tj
T*
(- backend/src/Http/AesGcmPayloadEnvelope.php enforces header + envelope format) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(1\) ONE-TIME POSTMAN SETUP) Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(1. Create an environment in Postman \(example name: Group8 Local\).) Tj
T*
(2. Add these environment variables:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- base_url) Tj
T*
(  Value: http://localhost/group8/api) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- transport_key) Tj
T*
(  Value: same key material as backend APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY) Tj
T*
(  \(Frontend uses this as VITE_TRANSPORT_ENCRYPTION_KEY.\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- auth_token) Tj
T*
(  Value: leave blank initially) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- last_decrypted_json) Tj
T*
(  Value: leave blank initially) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Create one collection \(example name: Group8 Required Endpoints\).) Tj
T*
(4. Add all requests under this collection.) Tj
T*
(5. Paste the scripts below at collection level \(so all requests inherit them\):) Tj
T*
(   - Collection Script > Pre-request) Tj
T*
(   - Collection Script > Post-response) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(2\) COLLECTION PRE-REQUEST SCRIPT \(AUTO ENCRYPT BODY\)) Tj
T*
(============================================================) Tj
T*
(Copy-paste this exactly into Collection > Scripts > Pre-request:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(const HEADER_NAME = 'X-Payload-Encryption';) Tj
T*
(const HEADER_VALUE = 'v1';) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(function decodeBase64\(value\) {) Tj
T*
(  const binary = atob\(value\);) Tj
T*
(  const bytes = new Uint8Array\(binary.length\);) Tj
T*
(  for \(let i = 0; i < binary.length; i += 1\) {) Tj
T*
(    bytes[i] = binary.charCodeAt\(i\);) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
(  return bytes;) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(function encodeBase64\(bytes\) {) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
